0,Angor language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angor_language,"Angor a.k.a. Senagi is a Senagi language of northern Papua New Guinea. It is spoken in 11 villages of Amanab Rural LLG, Sandaun Province, including Senagi village.",Angor,Senagi
